	| Okta ID       | koroneikicontact2                        |
	And I create a product with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I create a product with the name "Liferay Portal"
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I create a nested field for the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	And I rename the first contact nested field variable
	And I create a nested field for the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	And I rename the second contact nested field variable
	And I create a nested field for the account external link with the following values 
	| Domain      | koroneikiautomotive1 |
	| Entity Id   | 1234                 |
	| Entity Name | KoroneikiAutomotive1 |
	And I rename the first account external link nested field variable
	And I create a nested field for the account external link with the following values 
	| Domain      | koroneikiautomotive2 |
	| Entity Id   | 5678                 |
	| Entity Name | KoroneikiAutomotive2 |
	And I rename the second account external link nested field variable
	And I create a nested field for the postal address with the following values
	| Country               | United States   |
	| Locality              | Diamond Bar     |
	| Region                | California      |
	| Type                  | Business        |
	| Mailing               | True            |
	| Postal Code           | 91761           |
	| Primary               | True            |
