	| Region                | British Columbia |
	| Type                  | Other            |
	| Mailing               | False            |
	| Postal Code           | V5Y 0C9          |
	| Primary               | False            |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 456 Main Street  |
	And I rename the second postal address nested field variable
	And I create a nested field for the product purchase for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}         |                |
	| Original End Date       | ${staticOriginalEndDate} |                |
	| Perpetual               | false                    |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1          | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2          | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3          | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                        |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate}       |                |
	| Status                  | Approved                 |                |
	And I rename the first product purchase nested field variable
	And I create a nested field for the product purchase for the product "Liferay Portal" with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}         |                |
	| Original End Date       | ${staticOriginalEndDate} |                |
	| Perpetual               | false                    |                |
